findings.description:
Two DEVLOGs exist: `DEVLOG.md` at the root (latest entry 20260822) and `project-documents/DEVLOG.md` (where the slice 362 entries live). Tasks 8.6 and 9.2 say only "the DEVLOG".

8.6 asserts the diff against `main` contains only the skill, the generated concept, the slice documents and the DEVLOG. At that point:
- the DEVLOG isn't written yet (it comes in 9.2);
- 9.1 will also edit `360-slices.document-intelligence.md`, which isn't a "slice 363 document";
- an uncommitted concept file is invisible to `git diff --name-only`.

Fix: name the DEVLOG path, and either move the scope check after 9.2 or correct the expected set.
